VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '[music] up backward. Normally, I come down that way. So, I\'m excited to do this descent. I haven\'t done it for a while, but we\'re on some skinny tires. I\'ve got 29 mil uh tires. It\'s funny that\'s skinny tires now, but that\'s for another day. Right now, let\'s test this single lens view'

[02:51] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
