VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'frames a second, you get slow motion. Just to be clear, this is the image straight out of the camera. I haven\'t altered this image at all. Standard color mode, I\'ve set the EV to -0.7. That\'s just cuz I think most action'

[04:17] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'cameras kind of make everything brighter than they need to be. We\'re in the weeds. I\'m sorry. I can\'t help it. Again, level one, this is all you need to get started. But, what if you want more? &gt;&gt; [music]'

