AUDIO: 'where\'s the selfie stick? Insta360\'s invisible selfie stick was what allows me to get this shot. As a solo creator, there\'s too much going on on my head already. I\'m riding my bike, I\'m trying not to get dropped, I\'m thinking about the story that I\'m'

[08:55] [scene:talk]
