[10:14] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'hassle of moving from one program to another, the ability to get multiple shots with one camera position is invaluable. &gt;&gt; When it comes to [music] mounting your Insta360 camera, there are three classic options. You have the chest mount that'

