VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'gives you the POV shot, old standby. There\'s the integrated handlebar mount like what\'s on right now. That\'s going to give you a great shot of the road and also the inside of your nostrils. Lastly, there\'s the tail mount, which'

[10:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'mimics a drone shot if the drone was obsessed with your butt. Jokes aside, those are all great options and a lot of people have found long and fulfilling lives with just those three positions. But if things are a little stale and'

[10:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'you\'re feeling adventurous, let me show you some of the toys that I play with. The most versatile by far is this heavy-duty clamp. It\'s not a ball clamp, so it\'s not going to slip around. And if you pair it with this carbon fiber'

[11:06] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'selfie stick, you\'re going to have a lot of fun. You may be tempted to send your camera straight out to the side like this, and while that angle might look cool, I would advise against it for two reasons. First off, you don\'t want to clothesline'

